---
# Runner self-test: the clipboard is a file in the sandbox (SCARPE_CLIPBOARD_FILE, which
# fakebin's pbcopy, pbpaste and xclip use too), never the real clipboard. The first assertion stops the test before any clipboard call if the
# runner gave no sandbox file.
testability: api
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  button("Copy") { self.clipboard = "copied from the app" }
end
----------- test code
board = ENV["SPEC_CLIPBOARD_FILE"]
refute_nil board, "spec/run names a clipboard file for every case"
sandbox = File.realpath(File.dirname(Dir.pwd))
assert_equal sandbox, File.realpath(File.dirname(board)), "the file sits in this case's sandbox"

find_button("Copy").trigger_click
assert_equal "copied from the app", File.read(board), "clipboard= writes the sandbox file"

File.write(board, "put there by another program")
assert_equal "put there by another program", Shoes.APPS.first.clipboard, "clipboard reads it back"
